model b4
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input w: date
move pw: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  pay = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = 2026-03-10 "s"
ask b: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask p: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) from 2026-03-01 with w = 2026-03-08
